00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:22.240
from what was a privately held company, Lucasfilm,

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.620
is roughly in the region of 42 billion dollars.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.780
42 billion and 32 billion of that is from
